{"seq":2,"slug":"retention-engagement","title":"留存与参与度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-monetization-liveops/liveops/retention-engagement","wordCount":1335,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"留存与参与度\">留存与参与度</h1><p>变现的所有努力，最终都站在一个前提上：玩家还在。一个流失的玩家既不会付费也不会看广告，所以留存被公认为长期收入最强的单一预测因子（<a href=\"https://gamegrowthadvisor.com/blog/2026-03-17-mobile-game-kpis-benchmarks-2026/\">Game Growth Advisor, 2026</a>）。这一篇讲如何衡量留存、如何用习惯回路把一次性玩家变成日活、以及如何在玩家离开之前预警并召回。本 hub 里留存指标的定义与曲线，集中在这里。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>留存衡量的是「玩家在装机后第 N 天是否还回来」。它通常用一条随时间下降的曲线刻画——大量玩家在头几天流失，曲线陡降，随后趋于平缓，剩下的是粘性用户。下图展示留存的衡量与干预闭环。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[新玩家安装] --&gt; B[次日 D1&lt;br/&gt;第一印象]&#10;  B --&gt; C[七日 D7&lt;br/&gt;习惯形成]&#10;  C --&gt; D[三十日 D30&lt;br/&gt;长期忠诚]&#10;  B --&gt;|未回来| E[早期流失]&#10;  C --&gt;|未回来| F[中期流失]&#10;  D --&gt;|未回来| G[长期流失]&#10;  E --&gt; H[召回与预警]&#10;  F --&gt; H&#10;  G --&gt; H&#10;  H --&gt;|推送/福利/回归活动| A\">flowchart TD\n  A[新玩家安装] --&gt; B[次日 D1&lt;br/&gt;第一印象]\n  B --&gt; C[七日 D7&lt;br/&gt;习惯形成]\n  C --&gt; D[三十日 D30&lt;br/&gt;长期忠诚]\n  B --&gt;|未回来| E[早期流失]\n  C --&gt;|未回来| F[中期流失]\n  D --&gt;|未回来| G[长期流失]\n  E --&gt; H[召回与预警]\n  F --&gt; H\n  G --&gt; H\n  H --&gt;|推送/福利/回归活动| A</pre><p>下表给出 2026 年各品类的留存基准，作为衡量自家产品健康度的标尺。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>品类</th>\n<th>D1 留存</th>\n<th>D7 留存</th>\n<th>解读</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>超休闲</td>\n<td>~38%-40%</td>\n<td>较低</td>\n<td>量大、衰减快</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>休闲/益智</td>\n<td>~30%</td>\n<td>~14%-15%</td>\n<td>头部目标 D1 40%+</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中重度</td>\n<td>~44%-45%</td>\n<td>~20%-21%</td>\n<td>粘性更强</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>数据来源：<a href=\"https://www.gameanalytics.com/reports/2026-mobile-pc-gaming-benchmarks\">GameAnalytics, 2026</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"留存曲线与三个关键节点\">留存曲线与三个关键节点</h2><p>留存不是一个数字，而是一条曲线，业界用三个节点切片观察。次留（D1）反映第一印象——玩家在新手引导里是否理解了游戏的乐趣；七留（D7）反映习惯是否形成——玩家是否把游戏纳入了日常；月留（D30）反映长期忠诚——这批人正是日后贡献收入的核心。把留存曲线下的面积累加，就得到平均生命周期，它直接喂给<a href=\"../foundations/player-segments-ltv\">玩家分层与 LTV</a>里的 LTV 计算：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Lifetime</mtext><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></munderover><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Lifetime} = \\sum_{t=0}^{T} r(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Lifetime</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.0954em;vertical-align:-1.2671em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8283em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8829em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2671em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 天的留存率。这也解释了为什么留存是收入的根——生命周期越长，同样的 ARPDAU 撬动的 LTV 就越高。</p>\n<h2 id=\"习惯回路-让玩家天天回来\">习惯回路：让玩家天天回来</h2><p>把一次性玩家变成日活，靠的是精心设计的习惯回路。一个经典的回路是「触发-行动-奖励-投入」：推送或日常重置触发玩家打开，玩家完成一个小目标（日常任务），获得即时奖励，并因为投入了进度而更不舍离开。常见的回路设计包括：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>触发频率</th>\n<th>留存作用</th>\n<th>风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>每日签到</td>\n<td>每天</td>\n<td>养成打开习惯</td>\n<td>漏签愧疚（须温和）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>连续登录奖励</td>\n<td>每天累计</td>\n<td>制造连胜不舍断</td>\n<td>断签挫败</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>体力/精力系统</td>\n<td>周期恢复</td>\n<td>控制单次时长、促回访</td>\n<td>过紧伤体验</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>社交绑定</td>\n<td>公会/好友</td>\n<td>用关系拴住玩家</td>\n<td>社交压力</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>其中战斗通行证是当今最强的习惯回路之一——它的每日、每周任务给了玩家一个赛季的回访理由，相关结构见<a href=\"../monetization-design/gacha-battle-pass\">抽卡与战斗通行证</a>。值得强调的是，2026 年的会话设计趋势是「20 分钟内能完成日常」，而非要求玩家投入整晚（<a href=\"https://www.noobfeed.com/articles/session-loop-modern-live-service-gaming-in-2026\">NoobFeed, 2026</a>）——回路要轻，才可持续。</p>\n<h2 id=\"流失预警与召回\">流失预警与召回</h2><p>留住玩家不只靠正向回路，也靠在玩家离开前及时干预。流失预警依赖行为信号：登录频率下降、单次时长缩短、付费停止、活跃从核心玩法转向边缘。一个简单的流失风险评分可写成各信号加权：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>ChurnRisk</mtext><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{ChurnRisk} = \\sum_{i} w_i \\cdot s_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ChurnRisk</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3277em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 个流失信号的强度、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是其权重。当评分超过阈值，系统就触发干预——个性化推送、回归福利、专属活动。已流失玩家则靠召回活动拉回，节日活动尤其擅长此事（情感唤起 + 限定奖励）。这些召回动作的编排，属于<a href=\"liveops-events\">活动与版本节奏</a>；而预警模型的准确性与召回策略的效果，须用<a href=\"../analytics-ethics/ab-experimentation\">A/B 实验与优化</a>持续验证。</p>\n<h2 id=\"留存与变现的张力\">留存与变现的张力</h2><p>留存与变现并非总是同向，二者常有张力。过猛的变现（铺天盖地的广告、逼氪的设计、付费墙）能短期拉高收入，却会侵蚀留存，最终让收入的根基崩塌。健康的运营追求的是二者的平衡点——在不损害体验的前提下变现，让留存这条曲线尽量平、尽量长。这正是为什么所有变现动作都该用「整体 LTV 与长期留存」而非「单次收入」来评估，呼应<a href=\"../monetization-design/ads-hybrid\">广告变现与混合变现</a>里讲的短视陷阱。把握这个平衡，最终要靠<a href=\"../analytics-ethics/metrics-funnels\">核心指标与漏斗</a>给出的统一口径来度量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>留存是长期收入最强的单一预测因子；衡量为随时间下降的留存曲线。</li>\n<li>三个关键节点：D1（第一印象）、D7（习惯形成）、D30（长期忠诚）。</li>\n<li>留存曲线求和得平均生命周期，直接喂给 LTV 计算，是收入的根。</li>\n<li>习惯回路（签到、连登、体力、社交、通行证）把一次性玩家变成日活，2026 趋势是「20 分钟可完成」的轻回路。</li>\n<li>流失预警靠行为信号加权评分，超阈值触发个性化干预；已流失靠召回活动拉回。</li>\n<li>留存与变现存在张力，须用整体 LTV 与长期留存而非单次收入来平衡。</li>\n<li>本篇是 hub 内留存指标定义与曲线的唯一详述处。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"留存与参与度","id":"留存与参与度"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"留存曲线与三个关键节点","id":"留存曲线与三个关键节点"},{"level":2,"text":"习惯回路：让玩家天天回来","id":"习惯回路-让玩家天天回来"},{"level":2,"text":"流失预警与召回","id":"流失预警与召回"},{"level":2,"text":"留存与变现的张力","id":"留存与变现的张力"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"活动与版本节奏","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-monetization-liveops/liveops/liveops-events"},"next":{"title":"内容更新与季节机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-monetization-liveops/liveops/content-cadence"}}